      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2893fd87-fd4d-4f5d-b5e3-3287076b68b9",
      "title": "Escute a segunda etapa e repare em como ela se liga à primeira.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "1941eaac-3268-4b56-8ab7-1f82b44e697d",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora observe a ação que vem depois.</p><p><strong>Después voy a limpiar la cocina.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Depois vou limpar a cozinha.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/13de131d98034ed9b4d308cd1bfcbeab_b04-despues-voy-a-limpiar-la-cocina.mp3?Expires=1794099510&Signature=k~phiHPtCvR5~weLxDNwFW7PZZX4q~0KYDNah-IgETabXsE6xjOqCkErN8Se-eqN6O75V6--4fxqwKl0TaaY8YKWOETpSCxU0~P-gxxlu~WGl9iilfwkrJu8I-8Yx95lGAXBfU0jDvrr31uOX6UN~tdJDwRVfBiOyQpck5~Rf2OrVfpIm8kWpcuxiKD3YKFqIlYtEXqU60l8Uv3kXMwh1zhaOtaccN2p7i-eXnTf9~rJLkjIBUra50VImlvrGMZRtUhBT1C66M6YTKq5EIrfLoFSVOp05DUbo-JOn7nr0rpNQY7NVGQbh4JKYRJZBPGQGQXzOIELzrNLEazSbAIV2A__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
